<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2811" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰψηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶψα</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quick, speedy, sudden</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰψηρὸς δὲ κόρος κρυεροῖο
			γόοιο</span> satiety in grief <i>comes soon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.103
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῦσεν δ᾽ ἀγορὴν
			αἰψηρήν</span> he dismissed the assembly <i>in haste</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.276
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.257
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεφύρου αἰ. πνοαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Parth.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					515
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristarch.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶψα.</span>
			—Notin Trag.</div>
